(i32::MAX));\n    assert!(s.is_empty());\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn test_print_does_not_panic() {\n    let mut s = Stack::new();\n    s.push(1);\n    s.push(2);\n    s.print();\n    s.pop();\n    s.pop();\n    let empty = Stack::new();\n    empty.print();\n}\n\nfn main() {}\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":835,"cache_read_input_tokens":54715,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":835,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":38,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f93bc952-165f-424b-860a-54b258632cda","uuid":"ab09329e-f33f-4f4d-82cd-f4005838ff33"}
